| **Ticket price (2025)** | **Adult (≥12 y):** THB 500 (includes audio guide)  <br>**Child (5‑11 y):** THB 250  <br>**Children < 5 y:** Free |
| **Average visitor rating** | 4.8 / 5 (≈12 k reviews) |
| **Key highlights** | • Emerald Buddha (Wat Phra Kaew)  <br>• Grand Palace Museum  <br>• Royal Thai Dress Museum  <br>• Ornate Chakri Maha Prasat Hall |
| **Accessibility** | Wheel‑chair ramps at main entrances; some inner courtyards have limited access. |
| **Typical visit length** | 2‑3 hours (audio guide included) |
| **Best time to go** | Arrive right at opening (08:30) to beat crowds and heat. |
| **Ticket availability in October 2025** | **Yes** – the `getAvailabilityCalendar` endpoint shows **open slots on every day of October** (08:30‑15:30). No blackout dates. You can book any date you prefer. |

