## 2️⃣ Chatuchak Weekend Market – Full Detail

| Feature | Details |
|---------|---------|
| **Type** | Open‑air market / Shopping |
| **Location** | Kamphaeng Phet 2 Rd, Chatuchak, Bangkok 10900 |
| **Opening hours** | **Saturday & Sunday:** 09:00 – 18:00 (some sections open Friday 18:00‑21:00) |
| **Ticket price** | **Free entry** – you only pay for what you buy. |
| **Average visitor rating** | 4.6 / 5 (≈9 k reviews) |
| **Key highlights** | • 15 000+ stalls over 35 acres  <br>• Sections for clothing, antiques, art, pets, home décor, and a massive food court  <br>• Live music & cultural performances on weekends |
| **Accessibility** | Mostly flat ground; wide aisles in most sections, wheelchair‑friendly routes available. |
| **Typical visit length** | 3‑5 hours (or a full day if you want to explore every section). |
| **Best time to go** | Early morning (09:00‑11:00) for cooler weather and freshest stalls. |
| **Ticket availability in October 2025** | **Yes** – the market is **open every Saturday and Sunday** throughout October (09:00‑18:00). No tickets are required; just show up. |

